    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9083" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνιστορ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make inquiry into, ask about,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρνησις οὐκ, ἔνεστιν ὧν ἀνιστορεῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OT</u>
					578
				</span></i>
			: c. acc. pers. et rei, <i>ask</i> a person <i>about</i> a
			thing, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεύσει γὰρ οὐδὲν ὧν ῟ ἐκείνων
				ἃ</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> ἀνιστορεῖς ἐμέ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					963
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				991
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ph.</u>
				253
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σε . . ἀνιστορῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					110
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τινὰ περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					92
				</span></i>
			; <i>investigate,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				1.5.5
			</span></i>.</div>
